> **Farzana says:** "I have seen buyers receive their cushion cut diamond and be surprised by the sparkle pattern. They expected big flashes and got crushed ice. That is a cushion modified brilliant — which is what most cushion cuts are. The certificate tells you which variant it is. If a jeweler cannot tell you whether it is cushion modified or cushion brilliant, find a different jeweler."

