The emerald cut's elongated footprint means it reads as a longer stone across the finger. The cushion's square or near-square outline looks symmetric and substantial without elongating. Buyers who want finger-lengthening effect should note that the emerald cut's length does more work on the finger — but it is narrower, so the total face coverage is comparable.

